{
 "_comment": "Semantic SFX cues + the Pixabay search recipes used by scripts/fetch_packs.py. Cues are resolved against whatever is installed: a fetched Pixabay pack wins over the offline-synthesized kit, which wins over the built-in whoosh/pop.",
